@startuml users
title User scenarios
autonumber
actor "User" as User
participant "hermes (CLI / TUI)" as Client
participant "hermes-document-service" as HDS
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Create an account ==
User -> Client : Register (username, display_name, email, credentials)
Client -> HDS : Register(...)
HDS -> DB : Validate input and username/email uniqueness
alt Invalid input or duplicate identity
  HDS --> Client : Validation error; no entities created
else Valid input
  group Single transaction
    HDS -> DB : Create active user, personal workspace and owner membership
    HDS -> DB : Outbox: UserCreated, WorkspaceCreated, WorkspaceMemberAdded
  end
  HDS --> Client : Profile and personal workspace
end
note over HDS, DB
  Sign-in and logout are described in auth.puml.
  Credential method and initial email verification are to be specified.
  Credentials are excluded from profiles and events.
end note

== Read a profile ==
User -> Client : Open my profile
Client -> HDS : GetSelf(session)
HDS -> DB : Validate active session; read profile
HDS --> Client : Private profile and version
note over HDS
  GetPublicProfile exposes only public fields
  to users sharing a workspace.
end note

== Update a profile ==
User -> Client : Change display_name, username or email
Client -> HDS : UpdateSelf(changes, expected_version, session)
HDS -> DB : Validate version, format and uniqueness
alt Invalid input or stale version
  HDS --> Client : Error or conflict; no changes
else Email change requested
  HDS -> DB : Store pending email verification request
  HDS --> Client : Verification required; previous email remains active
  User -> Client : Verify new email
  Client -> HDS : ConfirmEmail(one_time_confirmation)
  group Single transaction
    HDS -> DB : Validate confirmation and uniqueness; update email and version
    HDS -> DB : Outbox: UserUpdated
  end
  HDS --> Client : Updated profile or verification error
else Username or display_name change
  group Single transaction
    HDS -> DB : Update profile using expected_version
    HDS -> DB : Outbox: UserUpdated only if fields changed
  end
  HDS --> Client : Profile and current version
end
note over HDS
  Username/email changes notify the owner with ProfileChanged
  if the users category is enabled. Display name changes do not notify.
end note

== Delete an account ==
User -> Client : Delete my account
Client -> HDS : GetDeletionBlockers(session)
HDS -> DB : Find shared workspaces owned by this user
alt Shared workspaces are still owned
  HDS --> Client : Blocking workspaces
  Client --> User : Transfer ownership or delete these workspaces first
else No ownership blockers
  Client --> User : Explain personal document loss; request identity confirmation
  User -> Client : Confirm account deletion
  Client -> HDS : DeleteSelf(confirmation, expected_version, session)
  group Single transaction; recheck all conditions
    HDS -> DB : Prevent concurrent ownership transfer; validate constraints
    HDS -> DB : Mark user deleted; revoke sessions
    HDS -> DB : Close personal workspace and documents; remove memberships/subscriptions
    HDS -> DB : Revoke pending invitations involving this user
    HDS -> DB : Outbox: UserDeleted, WorkspaceDeleted,\nWorkspaceMemberRemoved, WorkspaceInvitationRevoked
  end
  HDS --> Client : Deleted or conflict if conditions changed
  Client -> Client : Clear local session only after successful deletion
  Client --> User : Show result
end
note over HDS, DB
  Shared documents retain attribution as "Deleted user".
  Physical deletion and anonymization policies are to be specified.
end note
@enduml
